### TvTEvent::Timing ###
	AlarmTime/StandTime/EventTime/CloseTime in minutes - warning
	lead time, registration window, match duration, and cooldown
	before the next cycle.

### TvTEvent::Schedule::StartTime ###
	One or more scheduled triggers, matched against the real-world
	clock (-1 = any/wildcard for that field):
	Year/Month/Day/DayOfWeek/Hour/Minute/Second.

### TvTEvent::Entry ###
	Requirements to register:
	  ReqItemIndex/ReqItemLevel/ReqItemCount  Item that must be
	    held (and its quantity) to enter. -1 index = no item
	    required.
	  EventMap        Map the match takes place on.
	  WaitingGate     Gate players wait at before the match.
	  BlueTeamGate/RedTeamGate  Spawn gates per team.
	  SetSkin         Cosmetic skin id applied during the match.
	  MinLevel/MaxLevel/MinReset/MaxReset/
	  MinMasterReset/MaxMasterReset  Character requirements to
	    register. -1 = no restriction.

### TvTEvent::Reward ###
	WC/WP/GP - WCoinC/WCoinP/GoblinPoint paid to the winning
	team's players.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

